In Style (5B) – This group embraces the urban lifestyle.  They are fully connected to digital devices
and support the arts and charities/causes.  Most do not have children.  Meticulous planners.
Residents stay fit by exercising, eating a healthy diet to control their weight, buying low-fat foods
and taking vitamins.

Comfortable Empty Nesters (5A) – Residents in this large, growing segment are older, with more
than half of all households aged 55 or older; many still live in the suburbs where they grew
up.  Most are professionals working in government, health care, or manufacturing.  Many are
enjoying the transition from child rearing to retirement.  Physically active, they play golf, ski, ride
bicycles, and work out regularly.
